Source: uniwill-laptop
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jochem Kuipers <jochem@kuipers.cc>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
 cmake,
 pkg-config,
 qt6-base-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/JochemKuipers/uniwill-laptop
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/JochemKuipers/uniwill-laptop.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/JochemKuipers/uniwill-laptop
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: uniwill-laptop-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS driver for Uniwill / Medion ERAZER laptops
 Out-of-tree uniwill-laptop kernel module with a DMI match for the
 MEDION ERAZER Major 15 X1. Builds against the running kernel via DKMS
 and overrides the in-tree module when present.

Package: uniwill-control
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, uniwill-laptop-dkms,
 libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.4.0) | libqt6core6 (>= 6.4.0),
 libqt6gui6 (>= 6.4.0) | libqt6gui6t64 (>= 6.4.0),
 libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.4.0) | libqt6widgets6t64 (>= 6.4.0)
Description: Qt control app for Uniwill / Medion ERAZER laptops
 Desktop app to set keyboard RGB, the front LED strip, Fn lock, USB-C
 power split, extra GPU power, and to read temperatures and fans.

Package: uniwill-laptop
Architecture: all
Depends: uniwill-laptop-dkms, uniwill-control, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Uniwill laptop extras (driver and control app)
 Metapackage for the DKMS driver and the Qt control app.
